<title>UK: Abbey National prices $750 mln 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National prices $750 mln 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Nomura and Merrill Lynch, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC (RATED AA2/AA)</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    18.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.349   PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.749    SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LON/HK    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
